{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Strategy:</strong> Build and customize your camp with a variety of cards, each representing buildings, villagers, or consumables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Packs:</strong> Each pack gives random cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System:</strong> Collect coins from defeated enemies to upgrade the camp, unlocking new cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements:</strong> Manage resources carefully as you fend off increasingly difficult waves, balancing defense with strategic card play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a basic deck and a castle. Between waves, you can use collected coins to purchase new cards or upgrade existing ones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made with:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Godot Engine</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829830?t=1757334722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829830?t=1757334722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/f683464b6db24ac40c450d7127252d2fb2693216/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757334722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/f683464b6db24ac40c450d7127252d2fb2693216/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757334722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb